meta:
  id: comfort-check-in
  name: Comfort Check-In
  version: 0.1.0-draft
  description: |
    DRAFT, NOT TEAM-APPROVED. Placeholder mid-VR self-report triggered
    manually from Unity after the first sustained stick-walk. No source
    content exists elsewhere in this project for this survey (only the
    ComfortVignette shader is related, and it is not a questionnaire).
    Replace with a validated instrument (e.g. a licensed Simulator
    Sickness Questionnaire short-form) if comfort/cybersickness needs to
    be a reported outcome rather than just a self-pause affordance.
    The 7-point Likert labels below are invented to fill out the scale
    and have not been reviewed — confirm wording before real use.
  shortName: ComfortCheckIn
  tags: [comfort, mid-vr, draft]

questions:
  - id: comfort_q1
    text: Right now, how comfortable do you feel physically (nausea, dizziness, eye strain)?
    type: likert
    config:
      labels:
        - Very uncomfortable
        - Uncomfortable
        - Slightly uncomfortable
        - Neutral
        - Slightly comfortable
        - Comfortable
        - Very comfortable

  - id: comfort_q2
    text: Do you want to pause or stop the session?
    type: multiple_choice
    config:
      options:
        - "Yes"
        - "No"
